title: "AI-Enhanced OSINT: A Practical Guide for Illicit Trade Intelligence"
abstract: "A practical guide to using AI tools in open source intelligence (OSINT) work on illicit trade: which AI assistants and OSINT platforms are worth an investigator's time, where their data goes, how to keep an investigation safe, and how to verify what the tools produce."
